; EXODUS.BIN: Ultima III (Origin 1983, PC version by James R. Van Artsdalen).
; Generated by tools/gen.py; tools/build.py builds it (MASM, LINK, then the image from 0100).
; TEXT: long messages, shop and verse text (964F-A46F).
;
; Data only: the texts and menu tables of the town services (TOWNS), the pub's tips and
; Radrion's verses, and the end of the game (ENDING). Each string is quoted above its label:
; "/" is a line feed (0Ah), "|" the NUL that ends it. PrintMsg prints them in the message
; window. Menus for the library's AskChoice come as a key list (...MenuKeys) and a table of
; string pointers (...MenuStrs), some written as db. Prices are BCD words (5 g.p. = 0005h).
; Nearly every label is used by TOWNS or ENDING.
CODE SEGMENT BYTE PUBLIC
ASSUME CS:CODE, DS:CODE, ES:CODE, SS:CODE
